    "Cardiac Load measures cumulative cardiovascular stress using HR-based TRIMP (with pace fallback). Calculates Acute (7-day ATL) and Chronic (42-day CTL) training loads. Status based on the ACWR ratio (Gabbett 2016)." : {
      "comment" : "Cardiac load description",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
